@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5294
# Token JWT de papel Oficina, emitido pelo serviço de autenticação.
@Token = cole-aqui-um-token-jwt
@ClienteId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Liveness
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/healthz/live

### Readiness (inclui o check do PostgreSQL)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/healthz/ready

### Listar clientes
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

### Obter cliente por id
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/clientes/{{ClienteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

### Obter cliente por documento (somente dígitos)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/clientes/documento/12345678909
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar veículos do cliente
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/clientes/{{ClienteId}}/veiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar serviços
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/servicos
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json
